{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02142",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.8,
      "end_seconds": 6.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Yeah, hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.35,
      "end_seconds": 12.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.34,
      "end_seconds": 22.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.71,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a shaky feeling in my hands. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.08,
      "end_seconds": 25.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.57,
      "end_seconds": 29.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "I'd say on and off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.69,
      "end_seconds": 33.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.63,
      "end_seconds": 54.59,
      "duration_seconds": 19.96,
      "text": "Yeah, it usually comes with butterflies in my stomach. I've also had sweaty palms. Uh, as for butterflies in my stomach, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.93,
      "end_seconds": 58.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.7,
      "end_seconds": 62.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "it's moderate, honestly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.33,
      "end_seconds": 66.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.1,
      "end_seconds": 78.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.4,
      "end_seconds": 96.54,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, SpO2 97 percent on room air. And pressure 116 over 71, pulse 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.15,
      "end_seconds": 102.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "alright, over here please and and I'll take a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.76,
      "end_seconds": 106.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.19,
      "end_seconds": 126.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "there is a fine, fast tremor that goes away when the hands are resting"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.96,
      "end_seconds": 134.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Any sign of weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.26,
      "end_seconds": 140.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Let me think, not that I've noticed, no weakness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.0,
      "end_seconds": 146.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Have you had any fainting, palpitations or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.17,
      "end_seconds": 149.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.37,
      "end_seconds": 154.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.3,
      "end_seconds": 158.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.58,
      "end_seconds": 164.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.13,
      "end_seconds": 166.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.92,
      "end_seconds": 183.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.67,
      "end_seconds": 189.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.17,
      "end_seconds": 191.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.31,
      "end_seconds": 195.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.88,
      "end_seconds": 198.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.1,
      "end_seconds": 203.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.04,
      "end_seconds": 209.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.71,
      "end_seconds": 215.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.05,
      "end_seconds": 219.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.98,
      "end_seconds": 224.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Bisoprolol i take it once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.78,
      "end_seconds": 227.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.21,
      "end_seconds": 231.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "It's 2.5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.26,
      "end_seconds": 235.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Right, is that long-standing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.13,
      "end_seconds": 240.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "About nearly five years. It's febuxostat, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.09,
      "end_seconds": 244.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.54,
      "end_seconds": 252.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "It's 80 milligrams. I'd been on allopurinol, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.49,
      "end_seconds": 256.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.85,
      "end_seconds": 268.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.92,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.46,
      "end_seconds": 284.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.93,
      "end_seconds": 288.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.99,
      "end_seconds": 300.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.13,
      "end_seconds": 311.62,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "I've, I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes i didn't wanna make a fuss, you know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.53,
      "end_seconds": 314.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.48,
      "end_seconds": 317.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "I have gout."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.78,
      "end_seconds": 320.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.45,
      "end_seconds": 343.16,
      "duration_seconds": 21.71,
      "text": "Right, so gout is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Putting it all together, this looks most like an anxiety or caffeine-related tremor. An overactive thyroid is still possible. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a shaky feeling in your hands, and no fainting or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.85,
      "end_seconds": 345.55,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.32,
      "end_seconds": 349.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Let's book a thyroid test to look into tremor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 350.95,
      "end_seconds": 355.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 3:30 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.19,
      "end_seconds": 368.41,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "text": "Cut down caffeine and try slow breathing when it starts. Please come and see me in four weeks. Alright, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.15,
      "end_seconds": 373.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Right, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.17,
      "end_seconds": 377.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}